{
  "cohort": "Pure Conway Game of Life on a finite rectangular board, dead outside, synchronous B3/S23. Width and height 0 through 32; exact row-major list of binary U32 cells. step returns one entire next board; evolve applies the given Nat turn count. Zero turns preserves input. Judge each helper in its role and supplied caller context; do not infer popularity or correctness from style.",
